      ],
      "explanationZh": "第一段开头说她是六年级的英语老师。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p1",
          "quote": "I am your sixth-grade English teacher."
        }
      ]
    },
    "q2": {
      "correct": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanationZh": "“My favourites”里她喜欢的科目是科学和美术，说明对这两样感兴趣；她最喜欢夏天，也不是只爱热狗。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p2",
          "quote": "Subjects: Science, Art"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q3": {
      "correct": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanationZh": "她说自己的目标是帮助学生爱上学习。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p4",
          "quote": "My goal is to help you develop a love for learning."
        }
      ]
    },
    "q4": {
      "correct": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanationZh": "“Contact me”里写了电子邮件和电话，两种方式都能联系她。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p6",
          "quote": "E-mail:"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q5": {
      "slots": {
        "b1": {
          "accept": [
            "contact"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "trying to 后面要接动词原形，所以填 contact。"
    },
    "q6": {
      "slots": {
        "b2": {
          "accept": [
            "travelling",
            "traveling"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "go + 动词-ing 表示去做某事，go travelling 是“去旅行”。"
    },
    "q7": {
      "slots": {
        "b3": {
          "accept": [
            "pleasing"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "It was ... to know 说的是事情本身“令人高兴”，用 -ing 形容词 pleasing。"
    },
    "q8": {
      "slots": {
        "b4": {
          "accept": [
            "learned",
            "learnt"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "I’ve 是 I have，后面用现在完成时，要填 learn 的过去分词。"
    },
    "q9": {
      "slots": {
        "b5": {
          "accept": [
            "exciting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "something 是“令人兴奋的事”，修饰事物用 exciting。"
    },
    "q10": {
      "slots": {
        "b6": {
          "accept": [
            "develop"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "enable me to 后面接动词原形，填 develop。"
    },
